    Exceptions/                            — reserved: guard clauses currently throw
                                              InvalidOperationException; promoting these to named
                                              domain exceptions (e.g. InvalidSessionTransitionException)
                                              is a reasonable next step but is itself a breaking
                                              change to anyone catching the current type — flagged,
                                              not done here without your sign-off

